 "name_en": "Chemical Compliance Approval for Purchased Material and Supplier (31G)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Chemical Compliance Approval for Purchased Material and Supplier (31G)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio234e31b4c1044f7b9dd0816d11fa61e6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio234e31b4c1044f7b9dd0816d11fa61e6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item manages the compliance assessment for fulfillment of purchased materials and their suppliers.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Raw or purchased materials must cover compliance requirements of the associated products that are produced by using the raw materials.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The compliance data is requested from raw material suppliers. First, this lets you approve or block a supplier and second, assess the fulfillment of a raw material against the requirements. When this is done, you have approved suppliers and raw materials. Additionally, detailed compliance data is available for audits.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio234e31b4c1044f7b9dd0816d11fa61e6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Set compliance relevance for raw material master</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process request for external sourcing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assign supplier to raw material</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain supplier compliance data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assess compliance of raw material</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio234e31b4c1044f7b9dd0816d11fa61e6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Summarize usage of purchased materials requirements</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage coverage of requirements on a supplier level</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform supplier approval process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Aggregate and assess compliance on purchase material based on supplier data</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>面向采购物料和供应商的化学品合规性审批 (31G)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio234e31b4c1044f7b9dd0816d11fa61e6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio234e31b4c1044f7b9dd0816d11fa61e6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目管理采购物料及其供应商履行的合规性评估。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">原材料或采购物料必须满足相关产品（使用原材料生产）的合规性要求。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">从原材料供应商处请求合规性数据。首先，您可以批准或冻结供应商，其次，根据需求评估原材料的履行情况。完成此操作后，您已批准供应商和原材料。此外，详细的合规性数据可用于审计。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio234e31b4c1044f7b9dd0816d11fa61e6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">设置原材料主数据的合规性相关性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理外部寻源请求</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将供应商分配到原材料</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护供应商合规性数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">评估原材料的合规性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio234e31b4c1044f7b9dd0816d11fa61e6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">汇总采购物料需求的使用情况</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理供应商级别的需求覆盖范围</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行供应商审批流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据供应商数据，汇总和评估采购物料的合规性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
